	(text "Variant A (order 1, D10): BT1 fitted; DNP: C30, C31, J1, J2, R30, R31, R32, R42, R44, U3.\nBoth variants: C50, C51 DNP (tuning slots), TC1 footprint only.\nVariant B: BT1 not placed, the DNP parts above fitted (bom-variant-b.csv). Holder and\nUSB-C / JST / charger footprints overlap on the board on purpose (D15).\nMounting holes and the hanging hole are board-only footprints (layout generator)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
